# Only the Maven project and the Tomcat settings go into the image build. Documents, tests,
# scripts and the catch-up patches stay out, so editing them keeps the Docker build cache valid
# and scripts/observe-import.sh rebuilds the batch image only after the code changes.
*
!pom.xml
!wholesale-core
!wholesale-web
!wholesale-batch
!runtime
**/target
**/*.log
**/.idea
**/.vscode
